[16.399751, "o", "3. Configure the base model with 20 language classes (not the default 2)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[16.399879, "o", "4. Save the configured model and tokenizer to '\"'\"'/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
